From adc6fbed847834f41070a598773e1b31699edd85 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:35:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(tests): lathe_post_css's Gate map names the crates its
 modules live in

The Gate map named app::post, but the post suite's module lives in the
post crate since the M4.1 split, so the xtask test
no_gate_map_names_a_moved_module_as_app failed on main. Name it post::post,
as #965 did for the other headers. The other entries (app::cutting,
app::cutting_turn, app::commands, app::posting, app::project, tools::turning_data)
were checked against crates/*/src and are correct.

Fixes #1184

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs b/crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs
index b52e462fd..131029e17 100644
--- a/crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs
+++ b/crates/app/tests/lathe_post_css.rs
@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@
 //!
 //! Gate map (M4.4): covers app::cutting, app::cutting_turn,
 //! app::commands (ApplyCuttingData), app::posting (the CSS PARAMs),
-//! app::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),
+//! post::post (both lathe dialects), app::project (the additive key),
 //! tools::turning_data.
 //! Lane shape (M4.4): all tests here run in seconds.
 
